----------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY (web EditConflictBanner.tsx → native)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
  useEditLease(resourceKey) -> EditConflictLeaseSource seam (start/stop/refresh/claim); no bus in the view.
  isOwner || otherTab===null -> renders null  ==> native .owner -> never-a-blank-box empty; .electing -> loading.
  !isOwner && otherTab       -> AlertBanner    ==> .peerEditing(peer) -> warning banner (exclamationmark.triangle.fill).
  t('editConflict.banner.title')      -> ECBCopy.title       "Another browser tab is editing this"
  t('editConflict.banner.body')       -> ECBCopy.body        generic copy
  t('editConflict.banner.bodyWithLabel', {resource}) -> ECBCopy.bodyWithLabel  {{resource}} interpolation reproduced
  t('editConflict.banner.takeOver')   -> ECBCopy.takeOver    ghost TSButton -> model.claim() (web claim())
  t('editConflict.banner.switchHint') -> ECBCopy.switchHint  muted caption
  + native P4 states the web leaf delegates to its parent: loading / empty / error+retry / stale chip+auto-refresh / offline chip.
  + P1/S11 view.opened telemetry, surface slug "EditConflictBanner" (emitted once in model.start()).

